1268
01:17:05,038 --> 01:17:07,207
- Hah!
- (WHIMPERS)

1269
01:17:07,290 --> 01:17:08,792
(GROWLS)

1270
01:17:08,875 --> 01:17:10,376
(YELLS)
(GROANS)

1271
01:17:10,668 --> 01:17:11,878
