- (MOANS)

1274
01:17:19,093 --> 01:17:20,345
(GRUNTS)
(CRIES OUT)

1275
01:17:20,428 --> 01:17:21,846
(YELLS)

1276
01:17:21,930 --> 01:17:23,515
(YELLS)

1277
01:17:24,808 --> 01:17:25,850
Merida!

1278
01:17:27,852 --> 01:17:31,272
- (FERGUS GROANS)
- I'll not let you kill my mother.

1279
01:17:32,232 --> 01:17:33,900
- (FERGUS SCREAMS)
- Boys!

1280
01:17:33,983 --> 01:17:35,652
(SCREAMING)

1281
01:17:35,735 --> 01:17:36,820
Boys?

1282
01:17:37,821 --> 01:17:39,280
