1283
01:17:42,075 --> 01:17:43,368
(GROWLS)

1284
01:17:43,451 --> 01:17:45,119
- Mor'du!
- Kill it!

1285
01:17:45,203 --> 01:17:47,455
- (ALL YELLING)
- (ROARS)

1286
01:17:48,248 --> 01:17:49,833
(MEN SCREAMING)

1287
01:17:49,916 --> 01:17:51,918
You scoundrel!

1288
01:17:52,877 --> 01:17:53,878
(MEN GROANING)

1289
01:17:54,128 --> 01:17:55,129
(ROARS)

1290
01:17:55,380 --> 01:17:58,341
Come on!
I'll take you with my bare hands!

1291
01:17:58,424 --> 01:17:59,634
(FERGUS GROANS)

1292
01:18:00,009 --> 01:18:01,719
(FERGUS CRIES OUT)

1293
01:18:01,803 --> 01:18:03,847
(ROARS)

1294
01:18:05,890 --> 01:18:06,891
(WHIMPERING)

1295
01:18:06,975 --> 01:18:08,434
(SNARLS)

1296
01:18:09,936 --> 01:18:11,020
(SCREAMS)

1297
01:18:11,104 --> 01:18:13,106
(ROARS)

1298
01:18:19,112 --> 01:18:20,113
(ELINOR BEAR MOANS)

1299
01:18:20,405 --> 01:18:21,823
