1300
01:18:32,417 --> 01:18:33,459
Mum!

1301
01:18:34,711 --> 01:18:35,712
(GROANS)

1302
01:18:41,968 --> 01:18:43,887
(BOTH SNARLING)

1303
01:18:45,305 --> 01:18:46,639
(ELINOR CRIES OUT IN PAIN)

1304
01:18:49,267 --> 01:18:50,602
