1305
01:18:51,311 --> 01:18:53,313
(MERIDA SCREAMS)

1306
01:18:58,443 --> 01:18:59,986
(ROARING)

1307
01:19:05,867 --> 01:19:06,993
(CRACKING AND CRUMBLING)

1308
01:19:18,588 --> 01:19:19,589
(ROARS FEROCIOUSLY)

1309
01:19:20,173 --> 01:19:21,382
(SHRIEKS)

1310
01:19:43,029 --> 01:19:44,322
(GASPS)

1311
01:19:49,494 --> 01:19:52,246
(GASPS) The second sunrise.

1312
01:19:56,876 --> 01:19:58,544
(STRAINING)

1313
01:20:00,213 --> 01:20:01,255
(GRUNTS)

1314
01:20:03,216 --> 01:20:04,926
(WHIMPERS)

1315
01:20:25,196 --> 01:20:26,531
(WHINES)

1316
01:20:31,577 --> 01:20:33,413
No...

1317
01:20:35,164 --> 01:20:37,166
I don't understand. I...

1318
01:20:38,918 --> 01:20:40,920
(SNIFFLING)

1319
01:20:46,092 --> 01:20:47,593
(WEEPING)

1320
01:20:48,553 --> 01:20:52,140
Oh, Mum, I'm sorry.

1321
01:20:54,100 --> 01:20:56,352
This is all my fault.

1322
01:20:56,436 --> 01:20:58,438
I did this to you.

1323
01:20:58,938 --> 01:21:00,440
To us.

1324
01:21:01,357 --> 01:21:02,358
(SNIFFING)

1325
01:21:06,738 --> 01:21:08,740
You've always been there for me.

1326
01:21:10,116 --> 01:21:12,118
You've never given up on me.

1327
01:21:14,203 --> 01:21:15,872
I just want you back.

1328
01:21:19,083 --> 01:21:21,085
(MERIDA SOBS)

1329
01:21:21,544 --> 01:21:23,546
I want you back, Mummy.

1330
01:21:43,316 --> 01:21:45,318
I love you.

1331
01:22:10,051 --> 01:22:11,594
(GASPS)

1332
01:22:11,677 --> 01:22:12,970
(LAUGHS)

1333
01:22:13,054 --> 01:22:15,139
Mum! You're back!

1334
01:22:15,681 --> 01:22:17,225
(LAUGHING TEARFULLY)

1335
01:22:21,938 --> 01:22:23,272
You changed!

1336
01:22:23,356 --> 01:22:24,941
Oh, darling,

1337
01:22:26,192 --> 01:22:28,027
we both have.

1338
01:22:29,195 --> 01:22:30,488
Elinor!

1339
01:22:31,030 --> 01:22:32,865
Oh, oh, oh!

1340
01:22:32,949 --> 01:22:34,951
(ALL LAUGHING)

1341
01:22:35,284 --> 01:22:37,954
Elinor! Oh!

1342
01:22:39,163 --> 01:22:40,206
Ah!

1343
01:22:41,457 --> 01:22:43,292
Er... Urgh!

1344
01:22:44,127 --> 01:22:45,253
Oh, dear.

1345
01:22:47,255 --> 01:22:48,673
You're back. She came back to us.

1346
01:22:48,756 --> 01:22:50,633
It's a great day for this kingdom.
The curse is broke.

1347
01:22:51,384 --> 01:22:53,386
Oh! Mum.

1348
01:22:54,512 --> 01:22:56,305
Ooh. Erm... Dear?

1349
01:22:56,389 --> 01:22:58,057
- Eh?
- I'm naked.

1350
01:22:58,141 --> 01:23:00,393
Naked as a wee babby.

1351
01:23:00,476 --> 01:23:02,562
Don't just stare at me. Do something!

1352
01:23:04,063 --> 01:23:06,482
What the... Avert your eyes, lads!

1353
01:23:06,566 --> 01:23:07,984
Show some respect!

1354
01:23:08,067 --> 01:23:09,485
(ALL MUTTERING AWKWARDLY)

1355
01:23:09,569 --> 01:23:11,571
(PRINCES LAUGH)

1356
01:23:12,780 --> 01:23:15,324
Now that's what I call
a wee naked babby!

1357
01:23:15,408 --> 01:23:16,409
(LAUGHING)

1358
01:23:19,453 --> 01:23:22,165
Merida, Elinor, hurry up.
They're leaving.

1359
01:23:22,248 --> 01:23:24,417
- Mum!
- They're off! Come on!

1360
01:23:24,500 --> 01:23:26,627
We've got to wave them off!
Come along!

1361
01:23:28,588 --> 01:23:29,672
(MUSIC PLAYING)

1362
01:23:29,755 --> 01:23:34,552
<i>Though I may speak
some tongue of old</i>

1363
01:23:35,595 --> 01:23:39,015
<i>Or even spit out some holy word</i>

1364
01:23:39,098 --> 01:23:40,933
(PRINCES SQUEALING)

1365
01:23:41,100 --> 01:23:46,314
<i>I have no strength with which to speak</i>

1366
01:23:46,480 --> 01:23:48,024
Oof! (SCREAMS)

1367
01:23:48,107 --> 01:23:51,402
<i>When you sit me down
and see I'm weak</i>

1368
01:23:51,485 --> 01:23:53,821
(TALKING AND LAUGHING)

1369
01:23:55,615 --> 01:24:00,745
Goodbye! All the best!
Fair wind to your sails!

1370
01:24:00,953 --> 01:24:04,123
<i>We will run and scream</i>

1371
01:24:04,373 --> 01:24:06,125
<i>You will dance with me</i>

1372
01:24:06,209 --> 01:24:07,835
But how did this... (GROANS)

1373
01:24:09,170 --> 01:24:11,172
(BARKING)

1374
01:24:13,966 --> 01:24:17,470
MERIDA: <i>There are those who say fate
is something beyond our command,</i>

1375
01:24:18,304 --> 01:24:20,848
<i>that destiny is not our own.</i>

1376
01:24:21,349 --> 01:24:23,351
<i>But I know better.</i>

1377
01:24:25,061 --> 01:24:27,563
<i>Our fate lives within us.</i>

1378
01:24:29,398 --> 01:24:32,068
<i>You only have to be brave enough
to see it.</i>

1379
01:24:36,197 --> 01:24:38,199
(WISP LAUGHS)

1380
01:24:39,659 --> 01:24:43,037
<i>We will run and scream</i>

1381
01:24:43,120 --> 01:24:46,290
<i>You will dance with me</i>

1382
01:24:46,624 --> 01:24:51,629
<i>We'll fulfil our dreams
and we'll be free</i>

1383
01:24:53,631 --> 01:24:57,051
<i>We will be who we are</i>

1384
01:24:57,134 --> 01:25:00,554
<i>And then heal our scars</i>

1385
01:25:00,638 --> 01:25:05,476
<i>Sadness will be far away</i>

1386
01:25:22,910 --> 01:25:24,870
<i>So I had done wrong</i>

1387
01:25:26,205 --> 01:25:28,582
<i>But you put me right</i>

1388
01:25:29,875 --> 01:25:33,713
<i>My judgement burned
in the black of night</i>

1389
01:25:35,464 --> 01:25:40,720
<i>When I give less than I take</i>

1390
01:25:42,305 --> 01:25:46,100
<i>It is my fault, my own mistake</i>

1391
01:25:48,144 --> 01:25:51,480
<i>We will run and scream</i>

1392
01:25:51,564 --> 01:25:54,900
<i>You will dance with me</i>

1393
01:25:54,984 --> 01:25:59,947
<i>We'll fulfil our dreams
and we'll be free</i>

1394
01:26:02,158 --> 01:26:05,536
<i>We will be who we are</i>

1395
01:26:05,619 --> 01:26:09,081
<i>And then heal our scars</i>

1396
01:26:09,165 --> 01:26:14,754
<i>Sadness will be far away</i>

1397
01:33:27,769 --> 01:33:29,730
(SNORING)

1398
01:33:31,648 --> 01:33:32,941
(BIRD CAWS)

1399
01:33:33,025 --> 01:33:34,067
(SHEEP BLEATING)

1400
01:33:35,194 --> 01:33:37,196
Delivery. Sign here, sign here.

1401
01:33:39,364 --> 01:33:40,407
(CAWS)

1402
01:33:40,491 --> 01:33:42,743
Come on, birdbrain. I haven't got all day.

